\x22BUTTON_VIEW_MODEL_STATE_ACTIVE\x22\x7d\x7d\x5d,\x22lightThemeColorPalette\x22:\x7b\x22baseBackground\x22:4293982463,\x22raisedBackground\x22:4293982463,\x22additiveBackground\x22:558205641,\x22textPrimary\x22:4278853942,\x22textSecondary\x22:4282013294,\x22invertedBackground\x22:4279851407,\x22overlayBackground\x22:3423215926\x7d,\x22darkThemeColorPalette\x22:\x7b\x22baseBackground\x22:4278325276,\x22raisedBackground\x22:4278853942,\x22additiveBackground\x22:725977801,\x22textPrimary\x22:4292931322,\x22textSecondary\x22:4289513181,\x22invertedBackground\x22:4286362595,\x22overlayBackground\x22:3423215926\x7d,\x22backgroundColorStyle\x22:\x22BACKGROUND_COLOR_STYLE_COLOR_SAMPLED_ADDITIVE\x22,\x22enableClickableMetadataColorSampledText\x22:false\x7d\x7d,\x7b\x22expandableVideoDescriptionBodyRenderer\x22:\x7b\x22showMoreText\x22:\x7b\x22runs\x22:\x5b\x7b\x22text\x22:\x22...more\x22\x7d\x5d,\x22accessibility\x22:\x7b\x22accessibilityData\x22:\x7b\x22label\x22:\x22Show more\x22\x7d\x7d\x7d,\x22showLessText\x22:\x7b\x22runs\x22:\x5b\x7b\x22text\x22:\x22Show less\x22\x7d\x5d\x7d,\x22attributedDescriptionBodyText\x22:\x7b\x22content\x22:\x22Take control of your DHCP service with this step-by-step video guide. See how to link your IPAM to the DHCP Service to simplify configuration, enabling:\\n\\n✅ Effortless automation: Overcome limitations of manual configuration and streamline lease management.\\n✅ Complete visibility: Gain real-time insights into all your DHCP leases for informed decisions.\\n\\nHere\x27s what you\x27ll see in this video:\\n1. Introduction - 00:00\\n2. Linking IPAM and DHCP for automation - 00:08\\n3. Create pool in IPAM network - 01:23\\n4. Add DHCP options to the pool  - 02:26\\n5. See configuration in DHCP server - 03:20\\n6. Start client and get lease - 03:42\\n7. Lease in DHCP server - 04:19\\n8. Host synchronized in the IPAM - 04:37\\n\\n🌐 Follow Us:\\nWebsite: https:\/\/efficientip.com\/ \\nLinkedin:   \/ efficient-ip   \\nYouTube:    \/ @efficientip_ddi   \\nX (Twitter):   \/ efficientip     \\nFacebook:   \/ efficientip    \\nInstagram:   \/ efficientip_ddi   \\nTikTok:   \/ efficientip   \\n\\n👩🏻‍💻 About Us:\\nEfficientIP is a network security and network automation company, specializing in DNS, DHCP and IPAM, collectively known as DDI Technology. We make networking simple and secure everywhere. We help you deliver the best user experience at all times. We promote business continuity by making your IP infrastructure foundation reliable, agile and secure. \\n\\n🚀 Stay Updated:\\n#EfficientIP #DDI #DNS #DHCP #IPAM #DDIsolutions #NetworkAutomation #NetworkSecurity #DNSsecurity #DDIservices\\n\\nDon\x27t forget to like, comment, and subscribe for more DDI Technology insights! 🚀\\nThank you for watching! 🙂\x22,\x22commandRuns\x22:\x5b\x7b\x22startIndex\x22:411,\x22length\x22:5,\x22onTap\x22:\x7b\x22innertubeCommand\x22:\x7b\x22clickTrackingParams\x22:\x22CAcQ040EGAQiEwi4sP-SlduUAxUEWZ0GHY17CmLKAQSJgsL_\x22,\x22commandMetadata\x22:\x7b\x22webCommandMetadata\x22:\x7b\x22url\x22:\x22\/watch?v\x3d937l04pazbw\x22,\x22webPageType\x22:\x22WEB_PAGE_TYPE_WATCH\x22,\x22rootVe\x22:3832\x7d\x7d,\x22watchEndpoint\x22:\x7b\x22videoId\x22:\x22937l04pazbw\x22,\x22continuePlayback\x22:true,\x22startTimeSeconds\x22:0\x7d\x7d\x7d,\x22onTapOptions\x22:\x7b\x22accessibilityInfo\x22:\x7b\x22accessibilityLabel\x22:\x220 seconds\x22\x7d\x7d\x7d,\x7b\x22startIndex\x22:459,\x22length\x22:5,\x22onTap\x22:\x7b\x22innertubeCommand\x22:\x7b\x22clickTrackingParams\x22:\x22CAcQ040EGAQiEwi4sP-SlduUAxUEWZ0GHY17CmLKAQSJgsL_\x22,\x22commandMetadata\x22:\x7b\x22webCommandMetadata\x22:\x7b\x22url\x22:\x22\/watch?v\x3d937l04pazbw\\u0026t\x3d8s\x22,\x22webPageType\x22:\x22WEB_PAGE_TYPE_WATCH\x22,\x22rootVe\x22:3832\x7d\x7d,\x22watchEndpoint\x22:\x7b\x22videoId\x22:\x22937l04pazbw\x22,\x22continuePlayback\x22:true,\x22startTimeSeconds\x22:8\x7d\x7d\x7d,\x22onTapOptions\x22:\x7b\x22accessibilityInfo\x22:\x7b\x22accessibilityLabel\x22:\x228 seconds\