os\x22:32763908\x7d\x7d\x7d\x7d';</script><script nonce="gZOwFYbPQG36n7Fsrx7HGA">if (window.ytcsi) {window.ytcsi.tick('pdr', null, '');}</script><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=937l04pazbw"><title>SOLIDserver Hands-on #08 - Linking IPAM to DHCP for DDI automation - YouTube</title><meta name="title" content="SOLIDserver Hands-on #08 - Linking IPAM to DHCP for DDI automation"><meta name="description" content="Take control of your DHCP service with this step-by-step video guide. See how to link your IPAM to the DHCP Service to simplify configuration, enabling:

✅ Effortless automation: Overcome limitations of manual configuration and streamline lease management.
✅ Complete visibility: Gain real-time insights into all your DHCP leases for informed decisions.

*Here&#39;s what you&#39;ll see in this video:*
1. Introduction - 00:00
2. Linking IPAM and DHCP for automation - 00:08
3. Create pool in IPAM network - 01:23
4. Add DHCP options to the pool  - 02:26
5. See configuration in DHCP server - 03:20
6. Start client and get lease - 03:42
7. Lease in DHCP server - 04:19
8. Host synchronized in the IPAM - 04:37

