.\n\n*Here's what you'll see in this video:*\n1. Introduction - 00:00\n2. Linking IPAM and DHCP for automation - 00:08\n3. Create pool in IPAM network - 01:23\n4. Add DHCP options to the pool  - 02:26\n5. See configuration in DHCP server - 03:20\n6. Start client and get lease - 03:42\n7. Lease in DHCP server - 04:19\n8. Host synchronized in the IPAM - 04:37\n\n*🌐 Follow Us:*\nWebsite: https://efficientip.com/ \nLinkedin: https://www.linkedin.com/company/efficient-ip/ \nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@efficientip_ddi \nX (Twitter): https://twitter.com/efficientip   \nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/EfficientIP/  \nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/efficientip_ddi/ \nTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@efficientip \n\n*👩🏻‍💻 About Us:*\nEfficientIP is a network security and network automation company, specializing in DNS, DHCP and IPAM, collectively known as DDI Technology. We make networking simple and secure everywhere. We help you deliver the best user experience at all times. We promote business continuity by making your IP infrastructure foundation reliable, agile and secure. \n\n*🚀 Stay Updated:*\n#EfficientIP #DDI #DNS #DHCP #IPAM #DDIsolutions #NetworkAutomation #NetworkSecurity #DNSsecurity #DDIservices\n\nDon't forget to like, comment, and subscribe for more DDI Technology insights! 🚀\n*Thank you for watching!* 🙂","isCrawlable":true,"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/937l04pazbw/default.jpg","width":120,"height":90},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/937l04pazbw/mqdefault.jpg","width":320,"height":180},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/937l04pazbw/hqdefault.jpg","width":480,"height":360},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/937l04pazbw/sddefault.jpg","width":640,"height":480},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/937l04pazbw/hq720.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEhCK4FEIIDSFryq4qpAxMIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJD\u0026rs=AOn4CLCO6YEi0Hc3Uo3ZpEd2PR2KyMAxMA","width":686,"height":386}]},"allowRatings":true,"viewCount":"2717","author":"EfficientIP","isPrivate":false,"isUnplugged